## Blastgate automated security report

This is an automated report from Blastgate, a scanner for attacker-to-secret paths in CI workflows. It is limited to proven paths: Blastgate only reports a fail when it can trace a reachable path from attacker-controllable input to a secret or credential in \`acme/widgets\`.

